# GFN-FF OpenMP force-loop checkpoint
#
# Target: CREST 3.0.2 source bundle at base commit
# 932f6b0b810b1d3a62204bb181552a9de7ef27f4.
#
# Benchmark system: 938-atom host-guest structure; atoms 1-808 frozen,
# atoms 809-938 mobile. No structures, trajectories, or chemical identities
# are included in this patch.
#
# Scope:
# - deterministic parallel distance/dispersion-list preparation;
# - persistent per-thread hydrogen-bond energy/gradient accumulators;
# - parallel independent D3 preparation loops;
# - parallel hydrogen-bond candidate counting;
# - no changes to coordination-number definitions, topology construction,
#   or force-field equations.
#
# Validation:
# - five separated structures and OMP_NUM_THREADS=1,2,4,5;
# - worst mobile-gradient deviation: 1.7e-17 Eh/bohr;
# - energy deviation: approximately 1e-13 Eh or below;
# - CREST command-line single-point output agrees at printed precision;
# - the existing test suite passes at four threads.
#
# Representative 200-step frozen-host MTD wall times in the test environment:
# - 1 thread: 27.27 s
# - 2 threads: 25.73 s
# - 4 threads: 25.13 s
# - 5 threads: 25.35 s
#
